## Design (pending GPT review)
Per-buffer f4_committed_seq/f4_retired_seq/f4_submit_seq (+f4_owner),
all transitions under b_sema. Commit(iop_committing, dirty, dir-class)
opens obligation → mount-level hash keyed by owner ino (count++, GFP
fail → mount-wide overflow flag = treat all proofs open). Retire on
successful non-suppressed write completion covering submit snapshot
(s32 wrap-safe); relog-while-inflight keeps open. Cancel on abort/
stale. Proof conjunct in relbar (S_ISDIR): registry count==0, behind
knob (default 0 = telemetry), census probe when registry-open+walk-clean.
Probes: P284+ (P280-283 used). Ship 0.11.481.

